# What the image is built from is the source and the lockfile, and nothing else.
# A pattern here matches only at the top of the repo unless it starts with **/.

# Built or fetched again inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.astro
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# A family's data and an install's secrets never go into an image
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
credentials

# Not part of the app
.git
.github
.claude
.idea
.playwright-mcp
docs
apps/site
